[32m+[m[32mDedicated infrared hardware eye trackers (such as **Tobii Pro Spectrum** or **EyeLink 1000**) cost **$5,000–$25,000+**, use active near-infrared corneal reflection illuminators at 250–1000 Hz, and achieve **$\sim 0.5^\circ$ of visual angle accuracy** (enough to resolve individual words).[m
