[32m+[m[32mInstead of faking word-level accuracy, **GazeRead is an uncertainty-aware biometric instrument**:[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Self-Quantified Uncertainty ($\sigma_x, \sigma_y$)**: Every session ends calibration with **5 held-out validation targets** (that were never used to fit the regression model) to measure your exact horizontal ($\sigma_x$) and vertical ($\sigma_y$) RMS error in screen pixels.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Physics-Driven Granularity Selection**:[m
[32m+[m[32m  - If your measured vertical error satisfies **$\sigma_y \le \frac{1}{2}\,\text{Line Pitch}$** (e.g., $\sigma_y \le 33\text{ px}$ for $66\text{ px}$ line spacing), GazeRead unlocks **Line-by-Line Tracking Clarity**.[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Otherwise, it automatically switches to **Paragraph-Level Tracking Clarity** using **Soft Gaussian Credit Assignment** ($w_i \propto \exp\!\big(-\frac{(y - y_i)^2}{2\sigma_y^2}\big)$), propagating your measured calibration uncertainty directly into the attention heatmap.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Plain-English Reading Intelligence**: Translates raw gaze trajectories, fixations, and backward regressions into human-understandable diagnostics: **Reading Pace (WPM)**, **Focus & Attention (%)**, **Backtracking / Re-reads**, and a **Smart Review Helper** that automatically extracts the exact paragraphs you skipped, skimmed, or struggled with.[m
